OL,3,AMarried at First Sight UK cancelled
OL,4,Aafter BBC revealed rape allegations
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarried at First Sight UK will not
OL,7,Freturn, Channel 4 has said, following a
OL,8,FBBC Panorama investigation into the hit
OL,9,Freality TV show.
OL,11,FThe show's budget will be reinvested in
OL,12,F"distinctive new programming", the
OL,13,Fbroadcaster's chief executive Priya
OL,14,FDogra said on Thursday, and she
OL,15,Frepeated her apology to the women
OL,16,Finvolved in the investigation, for the
OL,17,F"distress they have clearly felt".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
