OL,3,AMarried at First Sight UK cancelled
OL,4,Aafter BBC revealed rape allegations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Channel 4 show was plunged into
OL,7,Fcrisis earlier this year, after a
OL,8,FPanorama programme which revealed rape
OL,9,Fallegations from two female cast
OL,10,Fmembers on the show, while a third
OL,11,Fwoman alleged a non-consensual sex act.
OL,12,FThe men involved have denied all the
OL,13,Fallegations against them.
OL,15,FA review was commissioned by Channel 4
OL,16,Fshortly after the BBC first contacted
OL,17,Fthe broadcaster, with details of the
OL,18,Fallegations we had heard.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
